{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_db4b23ace0cf477f94d25b00","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\n2\t<div aria-labelledby=\"giving-label\" class=\"panel grey audience clear\" id=\"giving\" role=\"region\">\n3\t<div class=\"header\">\n4\t<h2 id=\"giving-label\">Giving</h2>\n5\t</div>\n6\t<div class=\"wrapper clear content\">\n7\t<div class=\"description\"><p>Corravale is dedicated to putting its academic strength and resources to work for the good of the wider world. A deeply rooted culture of philanthropy is what makes that ambition attainable. The generous commitment of our Corravale donors changes lives each day.</p></div>\n8\t<div class=\"primary has-nav-blocks\">\n9\t<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"1\" style=\"height: 575.516px;\">\n10\t<h4>Corravale Giving</h4>\n11\t<ul>\n12\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Make a Gift to CU<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n13\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Stories and News<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n14\t</ul>\n15\t</div></nav>\n16\t<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"1\" style=\"height: 575.516px;\">\n17\t<h4>Ways to Give</h4>\n18\t<ul>\n19\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Give Today<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n20\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Crowdfunding at CU<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n21\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Cryptocurrency<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n22\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Donor Advised Funds<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n23\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Employer Matching<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n24\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Giving from Abroad<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n25\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Gifts-in-Kind<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n26\t<