 class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"1\" style=\"height: 426.734px;\">\n<h4>Outreach &amp; Partnership</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Government Affairs<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Industry Engagement Center<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Technology Partnerships <i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>CV + Rivbend<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Statewide Research Corridor<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"2\" style=\"\">\n<h4>Impact</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>CV + Fairhaven<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>CV + Rivbend<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Cost Savings &amp; Budget<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"secondary\">\n<div class=\"feature\">\n<img alt=\"Student volunteers help tend the Campus Farm at the Corravale Botanical Gardens\" src=\"/media/images/sidebar-images/initiatives-garden.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"caption\">Student volunteers help tend the Campus Farm at the Corravale Botanical Gardens</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Telling Our Stories\" id=\"sharing-our-stories\" role=\"region\" style=\"min-height: 430px; max-height: 1500px; height: 800px;\">\n<img alt=\"CV researchers have received a $2 million federal grant to identify and cultivate green algae that can power a high-yield, environmentally sustainable and cost-effective system for producing clean biofuels.\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/82b8d85bd2ab2b86.jpg\