&amp; Counseling<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n75\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Well-Being Alliance<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n76\t</ul>\n77\t</div></nav>\n78\t<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"3\" style=\"height: 295.75px;\">\n79\t<h4>Campus Employment</h4>\n80\t<ul>\n81\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Student Jobs &amp; Employment<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n82\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Campus Life Employment<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n83\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Graduate Assistant Positions<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n84\t</ul>\n85\t</div></nav>\n86\t<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"3\" style=\"height: 295.75px;\">\n87\t<h4>Academic, Research &amp; Cultural Programs</h4>\n88\t<ul>\n89\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Arts<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n90\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurship<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n91\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Global Corravale<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n92\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Our Roots<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n93\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Green Campus<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n94\t</ul>\n95\t</div></nav>\n96\t</div>\n97\t<div class=\"secondary\">\n98\t<div class=\"feature\">\n99\t<img alt=\"The 3-D Visualization Lab inside the Halverson Center on North Ridge\" src=\"/media/images/sidebar-images/currentstdnt-3dlab.jpg\"/>\n100\t<p class=\"caption\">The 3-D Visualization Lab at the Merriston Center on North Quadrant</p>\n101\t</div>\n102\t</div>\n103\t</div>\n104\t</div>\n105\t<div aria-labelledby=\"gallery-label\" class=\"panel white active\" id=\"gallery\" role=\"region\">\n106\t<div class=\"header\">\n107\t<h2 id=\"gallery-label\">Onward Now</h2>\n108\t</div>\n109\t<div class=\"wrapper\">\n110\t<div class=\"clear\" id=\"michigan-time\">\n111\t<div class=\"pusedo-list-item images\">\n112\t<div class=\"border\">\n113\t<img alt=\"Block C\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/block-m-maize.png\" style=\"\"/>\n114\t</div>\n115\t<div class=\"border\">\n116\t<img alt=\"24 Hours\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/24-hours.png\" style=\"\"/>\n117\t</div>\n118\t</div>\n119\t<div class=\"pusedo-list-item copy\">\n120\t<h3>All Corravale, all the time</h3>\n121\t<p>There's always something remarkable unfolding at Corravale. Whether it's across our campuses or somewhere far beyond them, our students, faculty, staff and alumni are busy chasing what's next. A selection of moments gathered over the years fills the gallery below.</p>\n122\t</div>\n123\t</div>\n124\t<ul class=\"clear\">\n125\t<li class=\"grid-4 unit8\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n126\t<img alt=\"The Aldridge Nature Reserve offers research and teaching opportunities across the natural sciences.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_500.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n127\t<span class=\"time\">6:42 am</span>\n128\t</li>\n129\t<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n130\t<img alt=\"A student gets ready for a morning class in the sunlit atrium of the Meridian School of Business.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/7d2e5d9e21f26e36.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n131\t<span class=\"time\">6:17 am</span>\n132\t</li>\n133\t<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n134\t<img alt=\"Members of the women's tennis team run through an early morning workout at the Calder Field House.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/a3bf3e87673f2073.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n135\t<span class=\"time\">7:33 am</span>\n136\t</li>\n137\t<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n138\t<img alt=\"A student worker readies the register for a new day at the Corravale Union.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/a5cf54c08444dbdc.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n139\t<span class=\"time\">7:09 am</span>\n140\t</li>\n141\t<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n142\t<img alt=\"A machinist working in the Corravale Scientific Instrument Shop.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/daba8bbd39dfbe1a.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n143\t<span class=\"time\">8:05 am</span>\n144\t</li>\n145\t<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n146\t<img alt=\"A research technician working in a laboratory at the Whitfield Cardiovascular Center.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/09d25592b3019959.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n147\t<span class=\"time\">8:48 am</span>\n148\t</li>\n149\t<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n150\t<img alt=\"Student musicians pound out rhythms on five gallon buckets during the pre-show entertainment at Spring Commencement.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/3fa3f186d919642b.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n151\t<span class=\"time\">9:11 am</span>\n152\t</li>\n153\t<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n154\t<img alt=\"ROTC cadets work together to hold and unfold a large national flag outside the Chemistry building near the central green flagpole during the annual Veterans Day flag-raising ceremony. In the background, cadets from the various ROTC programs stand at attention.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/044d154eb1914a4a.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n155\t<span class=\"time\">9:37 am</span>\n156\t</li>\n157\t<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n158\t<img alt=\"Medical students and residents speak with a patient and her mother during morning rounds at the Cranmore Children's Hospital.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/65b119af71e6c236.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n159\t<span class=\"time\">9:53 am</span>\n160\t</li>\n161\t<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n162\t<img alt=\"A group of seven students in Corravale gear smile and pose for a photo taken by a parent in a blue tee shirt at the Parents and Family Weekend Tailgate event in the Calder Field House.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/c342b80512e466ef.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n163\t<span class=\"time\">9:20 am</span>\n164\t</li>\n165\t<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n166\t<img alt=\"A research scientist at the Corravale Herbarium sorts seeds from plant specimens collected in the field.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/26143309ced199d0.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n167\t<span class=\"time\">10:34 am</span>\n168\t</li>\n169\t<li class=\"grid-16 unit4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n170\t<img alt=\"A Halverson Center audio resource manager works on three-dimensional sound for digital preservation, academic research and entertainment.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_500.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n171\t<span class=\"time\">10:07 am</span>\n172\t</li>\n173\t<li class=\"grid-16 unit4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: right; margin: 4px;\">\n174\t<img alt=\"A student in a gray hooded sweatshirt with headphones in works on their laptop in front of large windows looking out on the Hartwell Hall spires in the Ellison Undergraduate Library.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_500.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n175\t<span class=\"time\">10:29 am</span>\n176\t</li>\n177\t<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n178\t<img alt=\"A worker enters the campus Nanofabrication Facility on North Ridge.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/518ab92f8e42d88b.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n179\t<span class=\"time\">10:51 am</spa