"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"3\" style=\"height: 295.75px;\">\n<h4>Campus Employment</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Student Jobs &amp; Employment<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Campus Life Employment<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Graduate Assistant Positions<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"3\" style=\"height: 295.75px;\">\n<h4>Academic, Research &amp; Cultural Programs</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Arts<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurship<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Global Corravale<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Our Roots<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Green Campus<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"secondary\">\n<div class=\"feature\">\n<img alt=\"The 3-D Visualization Lab inside the Halverson Center on North Ridge\" src=\"/media/images/sidebar-images/currentstdnt-3dlab.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"caption\">The 3-D Visualization Lab at the Merriston Center on North Quadrant</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"gallery-label\" class=\"panel white active\" id=\"gallery\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"gallery-label\">Onward Now</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"clear\" id=\"michigan-time\">\n<div class=\"pusedo-list-item images\">\n<div class=\"border\">\n<img alt=\"Block C\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/block-m-maize.png\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border\">\n<img alt=\"24 Hours\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/24-hours.png\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pusedo-list-item copy\">\n<h3>All Corravale, all the time</h3>\n<p>There's always something remarkable unfolding at Corravale. Whether it's across our campuses or somewhere far beyond them, our students, faculty, staff and alumni are busy chasing what's next. A selection of moments gathered over the years fills the gallery below.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"clear\">\n<li class=\"grid-4 unit8\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"The Aldridge Nature Reserve offers research and teaching opportunities across the natural sciences.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_500.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">6:42 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A student gets ready for a morning class in the sunlit atrium of the Meridian School of Business.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/7d2e5d9e21f26e36.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">6:17 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"Members of the women's tennis team run through an early morning workout at the Calder Field House.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/a3bf3e87673f2073.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">7:33 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A student worker readies the register for a new day at the Corravale Union.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/a5cf54c08444dbdc.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">7:09 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A machinist working in the Corravale Scientific Instrument Shop.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/daba8bbd39dfbe1a.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:05 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A research technician working in a laboratory at the Whitfield Cardiovascular Center.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/09d25592b3019959.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:48 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"Student musicians pound out rhythms on five gallon buckets during the pre-show entertainment at Spring Commencement.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/3fa3f186d919642b.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">9:11 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"ROTC cadets work together to hold and unfold a large national flag outside the Chemistry building near the central green flagpole during the annual Veterans Day flag-raising ceremony. In the background, cadets from the various ROTC programs stand at attention.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/044d154eb1914a4a.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">9:37 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"Medical students and residents speak with a patient and her mother during morning rounds at the Cranmore Children's Hospital.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/65b119af71e6c236.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">9:53 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A group of seven students in Corravale gear smile and pose for a photo taken by a parent in a blue tee shirt at the Parents and Family Weekend Tailgate event in the Calder Field House.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/c342b80512e466ef.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">9:20 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" st