\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"ROTC cadets and adaptive sports athletes from two rival universities make their way down one of the sidewalks near the central green in the final leg of the Great State Race, carrying the game balls between the two campus towns in support of campus disability services offices.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:33 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A music student uses the natural acoustics of the woods to practice his french horn on North Ridge.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:19 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"Visitors view staff artwork in the Building 18 Rotunda Gallery at the North Ridge Research Center.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:52 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"Students on the sidewalk under the Central Campus Transit Center awning hurriedly step off and board a sleek electric-blue bus bound for the North Ridge dorms. The arrival boards hanging above the crowd of students on the sidewalk display the bus schedule.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:15 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A research team in the Ideation Lab develops a sensor ring that collects a patient's vital health data on campus.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:07 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A research team in the Ideation Lab develops a sensor ring that gathers a patient's vital health data on campus.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:44 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"The Movement Science 437 class outfits a student in a motion-detection sensor suit for a study on how knee injuries limit motion.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:26 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A view of the School of Public Health seen through the tunnel.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:58 pm</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n","numLines":249,"startLine":1,"totalLines":249}}}
