/li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Education</sp\n...TAIL...\n<span>CV Northgate</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>CV Harbor</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Social Media Directory<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Vax Portal<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Visiting Information<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>About Corravale<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"secondary\">\n<div class=\"feature\">\n<img alt=\"Faculty and students work side by side at a spectrometry bench in the Halvorsen Research Lab\" src=\"/media/images/sidebar-images/prospective-lab.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"caption\">Graduate mentors and first-year students run experiments side by side in the Aldridge Discovery Lab</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Voices of Corravale\" id=\"sharing-our-stories\" role=\"region\" style=\"min-height: 430px; max-height: 1500px; height: 800px;\">\n<img alt=\"A student sketches at an easel in a calm studio inside the Design and Arts Building on West Campus.\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/62770b005a33bade.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"sharing-caption\" style=\"bottom: -118px;\">\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-chevron-up\"></i>\n<p>A student sketches quietly in a sunlit studio inside the Design and Media Center on the West Quad</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n============================== faculty-staff.html\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"faculty-staff-label\" class=\"panel grey audience clear\" id=\"faculty-staff\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"faculty-staff-label\">Faculty and Staff</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper clear content\">\n<div class=\"description\"><p>Corravale is regarded as one of the best places to work in higher education, according to a national review of universities. We place a high priority on building an environment that helps faculty and staff do their finest work, and we value the contributions of every employee in keeping Corravale a leading public institution.</p></div>\n<div class=\"primary has-nav-blocks\">\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"1\" style=\"height: 718.297px;\">\n<h4>Tools</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Corravale Access<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Email<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Email — CHS<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Portal<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Community Directory<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Campus AI Tools<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Library Catalog<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Compliance Hotline<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Children on Campus Registration<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"1\" style=\"height: 718.297px;\">\n<h4>Jobs &amp; Career Paths</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Job Openings<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Career Explorer<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></nav>\n<nav class=\"nav-block\"><div data-row=\"1\" style=\"height: 718.297px;\">\n<h4>Faculty &amp; Staff Support</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Coverage<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\